Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 03:53:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: --dark, --light and --module-size CLI options for SVG
 output

toSvg() already takes dark, light and moduleSize, but the CLI had no way
to set them. The new options only apply with --svg; --light none (or
transparent) leaves out the background, and invalid values are usage
errors (exit 2), like --margin.

Closes #4
