+- CLI: `--dark <color>`, `--light <color>` and `--module-size <n>` for SVG
+  output, passed through to `toSvg()`. `--light none` (or `transparent`)
+  leaves out the background. They need `--svg`, and invalid values are usage
+  errors (exit code 2).
 
